  "description": "Motobecane USA has carefully crafted and engineered three categories of Carbon Fiber Road bikes.\n\nProRoad Built for Speed | Long and Low riding position is great for aggressive riders\n\n3Road Built for Comfort | Triple ring drivetrains afford lower gearing | Semi-compact geometry allows a more relaxed riding position\n\nProRoad Built for Speed+Comfort | Equipped with an eye for performance | Semi-compact geometry allows a more relaxed riding position\n\nThe Immortal Ice features a full Ultegra 8 piece group. Even the crank, bottom bracket and brakes are Ultegra 6700.\nThe Immortal series are the top of the carbon foodchain with a Monocoque High-Modulus Carbon Fiber frame and available High-Modulus Carbon Fiber fork. Ridden to countless victories by road cyclists. Tested extensively by Roadie International and Bicycling Magazine for several months to rave reviews.",
